      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Set & Prop Cardboard — Bulk Supply from Balakong</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Production designer, art director, prop builder, or event activator working in KL or wider Malaysia? We supply BC double-wall and single-wall corrugated sheets in stock and custom sizes. Pre-printed available, fast pickup or delivery.</p>
